                    <p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 9pt;"><a name="_Hlk29385294"></a><a name="_Hlk83025907" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Caltrans Mission:</span><span> Provide a safe and reliable transportation network that serves all people and respects the environment.</span></a></p><p style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 9pt;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Caltrans Vision:</span><span> A brighter future for all through a world-class transportation network.</span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 9pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">The Caltrans workforce is made up of diverse and unique individuals who contribute to our organizational success. Caltrans is about celebrating diversity, valuing one another, and recognizing that Caltrans is strong not in spite of the diverse attributes of our workforce, but because of our diversity.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 9pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">Department Website:</span><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><a href="http://www.dot.ca.gov" style="font-size: 11pt; text-decoration: none;"><span style="color: #0563c1; font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;">www.dot.ca.gov</span></a></span><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp; </span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 9pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">Frequently Asked Questions for an Applicant: </span><span style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><a href="http://dot.ca.gov/jobs/docs/faq-ct-applicants-081617.pdf" style="font-size: 11pt; text-decoration: none;"><span style="color: #0563c1; font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;">http://dot.ca